{"seq":3,"slug":"interference-diffraction","title":"高二物理 — 干涉与衍射","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/physics/optics-waves/interference-diffraction","wordCount":2009,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二物理-干涉与衍射\">高二物理 — 干涉与衍射</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>干涉和衍射是光的波动性最直接的证据。这两种现象用粒子说无法解释，而波动说能够给出完美的理论描述。杨氏双缝实验是物理学史上最美丽的实验之一，它不仅证实了光的波动性，更在百年后成为量子力学中波粒二象性讨论的核心实验。</p>\n<p>本节核心内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>光的干涉</strong>：双缝干涉、薄膜干涉的原理和条件</li>\n<li><strong>杨氏双缝实验</strong>：干涉条纹的形成与间距计算</li>\n<li><strong>薄膜干涉</strong>：肥皂泡的彩色和镀膜镜头的原理</li>\n<li><strong>光的衍射</strong>：单缝衍射和圆孔衍射</li>\n<li><strong>光的偏振</strong>：横波特有的性质</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-光的干涉条件\">一、光的干涉条件</h3><p>要产生稳定的干涉图样，两束光必须满足三个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>频率相同</strong></li>\n<li><strong>振动方向相同</strong></li>\n<li><strong>相位差恒定</strong>（相干光源）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>普通光源的不同部分发出的光是随机的，无法直接干涉。杨氏双缝实验的巧妙之处在于用一束光通过两条狭缝产生两个相干光源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-杨氏双缝实验\">二、杨氏双缝实验</h3><p>1801 年托马斯·杨首次完成了双缝干涉实验，成功地在屏幕上观察到了明暗交替的干涉条纹。</p>\n<p><strong>实验原理</strong>：</p>\n<p>单色光通过两条相距为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的平行狭缝后，在距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的屏幕上产生干涉图样。屏幕上某点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 到两狭缝的路程差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>明纹（加强）条件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>λ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = d\\sin\\theta = n\\lambda \\quad (n = 0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\ldots)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nλ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>暗纹（减弱）条件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = d\\sin\\theta = \\left(n + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>相邻明纹间距</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta y = \\frac{L\\lambda}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>从这个公式可以看出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，条纹间距越宽（红光的条纹间距大于紫光）</li>\n<li>缝间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，条纹间距越宽</li>\n<li>屏到狭缝的距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，条纹间距越宽</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>白光干涉</strong>：用白光做双缝实验时，中央明纹为白色（所有波长在中央的路程差均为零），两侧出现彩色条纹（不同颜色的条纹间距不同，导致各色光错开分布）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-薄膜干涉\">三、薄膜干涉</h3><p>当光射到透明薄膜（如肥皂泡、油膜、镀膜镜片）时，从薄膜上、下表面反射的两束光发生干涉。</p>\n<p><strong>等厚干涉</strong>：当薄膜厚度均匀变化时，干涉条纹沿等厚线分布。</p>\n<p><strong>肥皂泡的彩色</strong>：白光照射肥皂泡薄膜，不同厚度的区域对不同波长的光产生加强或减弱，呈现不同颜色。随着薄膜蒸发变薄，颜色会发生变化。</p>\n<p><strong>增透膜（镀膜镜头）</strong>：</p>\n<p>相机镜头表面镀一层厚度为特定值的透明薄膜。当薄膜厚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2nd = \\frac{\\lambda}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\frac{\\lambda}{4n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为薄膜折射率），从薄膜上下表面反射的光恰好发生相消干涉，减少了反射损失，增加了透射光的强度。</p>\n<p>相机镜头呈淡紫色，是因为增透膜通常对绿光（人眼最敏感的颜色）优化设计，绿光的反射被最大程度地抑制，剩余的反射光偏向红色和蓝色端，混合后呈淡紫色。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-光的衍射\">四、光的衍射</h3><p>光在传播过程中遇到障碍物或通过小孔时偏离直线传播的现象称为衍射。</p>\n<p><strong>发生显著衍射的条件</strong>：障碍物或孔的尺寸与光的波长<strong>可比</strong>或更小。</p>\n<p>由于可见光的波长很短（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>700</mn><mtext>nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">700\\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">700</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>），日常生活中光的衍射现象不明显，这就是为什么我们通常认为&quot;光沿直线传播&quot;。但在精密实验中，衍射效应不可忽略。</p>\n<p><strong>单缝衍射</strong>：单色光通过一条狭缝后，在屏上形成中央明纹较宽、两侧明纹逐渐变窄变暗的图样。</p>\n<p>与双缝干涉的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>双缝干涉</th>\n<th>单缝衍射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>条纹特征</td>\n<td>等间距、等亮度的明暗条纹</td>\n<td>中央明纹最宽最亮，两侧逐渐减弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中央明纹宽度</td>\n<td>与其他明纹等宽</td>\n<td>是其他明纹宽度的两倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理本质</td>\n<td>两个相干光源的叠加</td>\n<td>同一波前上不同部分的叠加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>衍射极限</strong>：由于衍射效应，任何光学仪器的分辨率都有一个理论上限。望远镜口径越大，分辨率越高——这就是为什么天文望远镜需要做得尽可能大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-光的偏振\">五、光的偏振</h3><p><strong>偏振</strong>是横波特有的现象，纵波没有偏振。光的偏振现象证明了光是横波。</p>\n<p>自然光的振动方向在垂直于传播方向的平面内沿各个方向均匀分布。当自然光通过偏振片后，只有一个特定方向的振动分量能够通过，形成<strong>偏振光</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>马吕斯定律</strong>：偏振光通过分析器（第二块偏振片）后的光强：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = I_0 \\cos^2\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0141em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 为偏振方向与分析器透振方向之间的夹角。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 90°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（完全消光）。</p>\n<p><strong>偏振的应用</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏光太阳镜</td>\n<td>过滤水面、路面等反射产生的部分偏振光，减少眩光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>液晶显示（LCD）</td>\n<td>利用电场控制液晶分子旋转偏振光的方向来控制亮度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D 电影</td>\n<td>左右眼分别接收不同偏振方向的图像，产生立体效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应力分析</td>\n<td>透明材料在应力下产生双折射，通过偏振光可以看到应力分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>杨氏双缝实验中，缝间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0.2\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，缝到屏的距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 1\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，使用波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mtext>nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 600\\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的单色光。求相邻明纹间距。</li>\n<li>如果将上题中的单色光换成波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mtext>nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 400\\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的紫光，条纹间距会如何变化？</li>\n<li>为什么肥皂泡薄膜在变薄的过程中颜色会变化？最终消失前会变成什么颜色？</li>\n<li>解释为什么用白光做双缝实验时，中央条纹是白色的，而两侧是彩色的。</li>\n<li>两块偏振片的偏振方向互相垂直，在它们之间再插入一块偏振片，偏振方向与第一块成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45°</span></span></span></span></span>，最终是否有光通过？为什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>杨氏双缝实验在物理学史上有着极为特殊的地位。在经典物理学中，它证明了光的波动性；在量子物理学中，即使一次只发射一个光子，经过长时间积累后，屏幕上仍然会出现干涉图样——这意味着单个光子同时通过了两条缝！这个令人困惑的结果是量子力学最核心的谜团之一。</p>\n<p>理查德·费曼曾说：&quot;双缝实验包含了量子力学的全部奥秘。&quot;如果你理解了双缝实验中&quot;单粒子干涉&quot;的深层含义，你就触及了现代物理学最深刻的问题。</p>\n<p>光的衍射极限启发了超分辨显微技术的发展。2014 年诺贝尔化学奖授予了超分辨荧光显微技术的发明者，他们突破了光学显微镜约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext>nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分辨率极限，实现了纳米尺度的生物成像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光的干涉需要相干光源，双缝干涉条纹间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta y = L\\lambda / d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>薄膜干涉解释了肥皂泡的彩色和镀膜镜头的增透原理</li>\n<li>衍射在障碍物尺寸与波长可比时显著，单缝衍射的中央明纹最宽最亮</li>\n<li>偏振现象证明光是横波，偏振光通过分析器的强度遵循马吕斯定律</li>\n<li>干涉和衍射是光的波动性的核心证据，对现代光学技术有深远影响</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二物理 — 干涉与衍射","id":"高二物理-干涉与衍射"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、光的干涉条件","id":"一-光的干涉条件"},{"level":3,"text":"二、杨氏双缝实验","id":"二-杨氏双缝实验"},{"level":3,"text":"三、薄膜干涉","id":"三-薄膜干涉"},{"level":3,"text":"四、光的衍射","id":"四-光的衍射"},{"level":3,"text":"五、光的偏振","id":"五-光的偏振"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二物理 — 光学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/physics/optics-waves/light-optics"},"next":{"title":"高二物理 — 量子初步","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/physics/modern-physics/quantum-basics"}}